error[E0303]: linear variable `g` is used more than once
  --> tests/cirkalang/fail/own/holder_let.cirka:16:19
   |
15 |   let g = f (MkTok 3) in
   |             --------- its value holds this linear value
16 |   printInt (g 1 + g 2)
   |             - first use
   |                   ^
   = note: `g` is linear because its value holds a linear value
   = help: use it only once, or make it a function that creates the linear value at each call
